{"story_id":87329,"updated_at":"2026-11-20T05:09:46","headline_en":"India bowls out New Zealand for 368 on day two of Test","headline_hi":"भारत ने टेस्ट के दूसरे दिन न्यू जीलैंड को 368 रन पर ऑल आउट कर दिया।","payload_en":{"story_id":87329,"headline":"India bowls out New Zealand for 368 on day two of Test","counts":{"articles":2,"independent_sources":2,"outlets":2},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"express","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["The Hindu","Times of India"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":23433,"parents":[{"story_id":56491,"headline":"New Zealand defeats India by seven wickets at Seddon Park"},{"story_id":67897,"headline":"New Zealand A faces 428-run deficit after Prasidh Krishna takes two wickets"}],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-11-20T05:09:46","category":{"v":2,"primary":["india"],"secondary":["life"],"tertiary":["sport-films"]},"places":[],"people":["Glenn Phillips","Henry Nicholls","New Zealand","Test","Anshul Kamboj","Basin Reserve","Akash Deep","Jasprit Bumrah"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"New Zealand's innings ended at 368 runs.","ids":[151570],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"On Day 2, Jasprit Bumrah changed ends.","ids":[151571],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Anshul Kamboj replaced Prasidh Krishna.","ids":[151597],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"India picked up the remaining four wickets.","ids":[151573],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Henry Nicholls and Nathan Smith spent the majority of the morning session on the second day of the opening Test at the crease.","ids":[151588],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"The pitch (The Basin Reserve pitch) was comfortable for batting on the second day.","ids":[151578],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"On Friday, Akash Deep struck in his third over by dismissing Glenn Phillips in the morning, breaching his defence and hitting the top of off stump.","ids":[151590,151586,151591],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"During the morning session on Day Two, Phillips scored a century in the Test match.","ids":[151587],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"The batsman is only the second player to achieve hundreds in every format against the same opponent within a single calendar year.","ids":[151576,151594],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"Phillips celebrated his milestone on Day Two after removing his helmet.","ids":[151589],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Nicholls and Phillips had a 216-run partnership for the sixth wicket, and Phillips resumed his innings on 94.","ids":[151574,151595],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"Nicholls scored 175 runs off 335 balls, and is not out on 146 runs.","ids":[151575,151593],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"The Basin Reserve pitch had a 15mm grass cover that looked burnt on the second day, and it improved the average of Nicholls at the venue to 91.5.","ids":[151577,151582],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"New Zealand was previously at 70 for five, and reached 317 for six at lunch on the second day.","ids":[151600,151592],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Phillips scored four runs off Kamboj.","ids":[151598],"class":"single","sources":[2]}]],"section_keys":["news","happened","happened","happened","happened","numbers","numbers","numbers"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/cricket/india-vs-new-zealand/50/4-and-a-lot-of-heat-how-akash-deep-sparked-indias-turnaround-on-day-2/articleshow/136010941.cms","outlet":"Times of India","title":"50/4 and a lot of heat: How Akash Deep sparked India's turnaround on Day 2","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/india-vs-new-zealand-opening-test-match-day-2-updates/article71722879.ece","outlet":"The Hindu","title":"IND vs NZ, 1st Test: New Zealand 317-6 at lunch on day 2 after Phillips ton against India","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true}],"oth