":[{"outlet":"Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/cricket/india-vs-new-zealand/50/4-and-a-lot-of-heat-how-akash-deep-sparked-indias-turnaround-on-day-2/articleshow/136010941.cms","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Henry Nicholls and Glenn Phillips had a 216-run partnership for the sixth wicket.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/cricket/india-vs-new-zealand/50/4-and-a-lot-of-heat-how-akash-deep-sparked-indias-turnaround-on-day-2/articleshow/136010941.cms","stance":"asserts"},{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/india-vs-new-zealand-opening-test-match-day-2-updates/article71722879.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Henry Nicholls scored 175 runs off 335 balls.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/cricket/india-vs-new-zealand/50/4-and-a-lot-of-heat-how-akash-deep-sparked-indias-turnaround-on-day-2/articleshow/136010941.cms","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Glenn Phillips is the second player to hit hundreds across formats against the same team in a single year.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/cricket/india-vs-new-zealand/50/4-and-a-lot-of-heat-how-akash-deep-sparked-indias-turnaround-on-day-2/articleshow/136010941.cms","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"The Basin Reserve pitch had a 15mm grass cover that looked burnt on the second day.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/cricket/india-vs-new-zealand/50/4-and-a-lot-of-heat-how-akash-deep-sparked-indias-turnaround-on-day-2/articleshow/136010941.cms","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"The pitch was comfortable for batting on the second day.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Times of India","